  skos:altLabel "Ontology | Core | Domain"@en ;
  dct:description "An ontology that defines the concepts and relations shared by every domain of the company, aligned to Basic Formal Ontology and anchored on the process step, so that every domain ontology extends it and every fact can be traced to the step in which it is created, used, or governed."@en ;
